AAAAUQsD4MFef+IGYInluM4GcInluM4G","COoHELLUr84GGUMNsQIAAHABIbk/rm4BABABKToeIAAAAAAAUWoEcD31fuIGYOnar84GcLLUr84G"]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Saber Interactive","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/SaberInteractive"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Focus Entertainment","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/Focus"}],"rgFranchises":[]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p align=&quot;center&quot;][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/34a9db3c4783eb653d2baa1e51847592.poster.avif?t=1774375225\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/34a9db3c4783eb653d2baa1e51847592.webm?t=1774375225\" width=\"616\" height=\"200\"][/imgvid][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"78\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/f47a2801aeac57e0ea53958b4b6c9664.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]你是一家天災災區重建公司的負責人，請使用各種工程機械幫助當地產業恢復生機。過程中你需要清理破瓦殘礫與故障設備、重建在天災中損壞的道路與橋樑，以外還有更多其他工作等你來幫忙！  [/p][p][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/549ca2c63eaf6d2a76d9f8e509bab561.webp?t=1774375225[/img][img width=\"616\" height=\"175\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/a5524b5fcd02f8b773504c34871db80a.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]你是一家災區重建公司的負責人，你們擅長修復因天災而遭破壞的區域。無數任務等著你，運用工程機械的力量，幫助當地產業恢復生機！過程中你需要清理破瓦殘礫、更換故障的設備、重建在天災中損壞的道路與橋樑，部署資源車隊任務以生產出新重建材料，此外還有更多其他豐富的任務等你來處理！ [/p][p][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/4b2bca8aaccc9268d34b3416913fba25.webp?t=1774375225[/img][img width=\"616\" height=\"174\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/298dfccb6573cd222a9b32be2e1c6afd.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]快來體驗這款由《MudRunner》與《SnowRunner》的開發商 Saber Interactive 所打造的新世代尖端模擬遊戲！處理每個物體時都要考量到包括質量與體積在內的現實世界物理特性。玩家除了能與沙子、木材與瀝青等元素互動以外，還能重新打造某個區域，建造全新道路讓你的載具更無障礙地移動。 [/p][p][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/3ec3eb52e1d8da07ae515d788a230a5c.webp?t=1774375225[/img][img width=\"616\" height=\"174\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/07fc624f9d9ba8f902ab92d7b3525251.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]每一款機械都有專屬操作方式。比如使用推土機清理障礙物、使用大型運輸車運載多輛載具，或者是使用固定式與橋式起重機舉起貨櫃與設備。此外，玩家還能使用電纜敷設裝置讓工廠重新連接至輸電網路、使用鋪路機用熱瀝青鋪路後，再使用壓路機壓平，藉此打造出屬於自己的道路。隨著劇情推動，玩家能解鎖超過四十款以上的載具。請造訪車庫自訂出有著公司標誌的機械，並用你喜歡的色彩替載具上色。 [/p][p][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/62c91dfaf3df9a697dcf9612859af99a.webp?t=1774375225[/img][img width=\"616\" height=\"175\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/9f5dfbac1ca67be2124ca901ba603a43.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]災厄使各地出現災情，並且切斷無數區域間的通道。你是唯一能在這個嚴峻情況下改變世界的希望。不論是山區、沙漠深處或是海邊，全球都需要你提供技術支援！總共八張面積四平方公里的地圖中，都有著獨特的生態環境與建築物等你體驗。規劃自己的行程，在廢棄工廠、淹水的水壩或已經無法提供服務的太陽能發電廠中穿梭。仔細探索每個角落以達成你的目標，同時也要確保獲得新合約與豐足的資金及經驗值。 [/p][p][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/aa0b43882687e9a827e66232311e2f50.webp?t=1774375225[/img][img width=\"616\" height=\"175\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/10ee54602ec22953acccc80e07b2f4ed.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]收集木材、鋼鐵與水泥殘骸，在你的回收廠中把這些重塑成可用的建材，讓每一塊破瓦殘礫都能用於重建！供應資源給工廠與砂石場，讓他們能製造大規模地製造出材料。此外，你身為營運經理的責任，就是必須在地圖上指出正確路線，讓你的運輸車輛能通行無阻！ [/p][p][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/a79ea2492c91c3ab0814821f172fc078.webp?t=1774375225[/img][img width=\"616\" height=\"175\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104890/extras/633f21477cf540ad8adff39de45f9c92.avif?t=1774375225[/img][/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]《RoadCraft》的世界中有多種活動，玩家們不妨找朋友一起同樂。合作模式最多可四人同時遊玩，玩家之間可以各自為政也可以或合作執行一個目標。你們能結合優勢與獨創力以找出解決方案，說不定還能探索出意料之外的辦法喔。[/p]","strSnippet":"你是一家天災災區重建公司的負責人，請使用各種工程機械幫助當地產業恢復生機。過程中你需要清理破瓦殘礫與故障設備、重建在天災中損壞的道路與橋樑，以外還有更多其他工作等你來幫忙！"}}],["achievements",{"version":2,"data":{"vecHighlight":[],"vecUnachieved":[{"strID":"ach_04","strName":"家族傳承","strDescription":"收到第一輛生鏽車輛","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2104890/074fcbfc54bdaab9c147043c0ac9cd4e566354ed.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":95.0999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ach_07","strName":"海岸危機","strDescription":"加固岌岌可危的海岸線堤壩","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2104890/074fcbfc54bdaab9c147043c0ac9cd4e566354ed.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":75,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ach_26","strName":"我就知道能接起來","strDescription":"規劃路線，讓250輛車在該路線上順暢通行","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2104890/074fcbfc54bdaab9c147043c0ac9cd4e566354ed.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":44.79999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":250},{"strID":"ach_23","strName":"道路修補","strDescription":"鋪設1000平方公尺的瀝青","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2104890/074fcbfc54bdaab9c147043c0ac9cd4e566354ed.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":42.70000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":1